# VTuber Avatar Assets

Place real Live2D or VRM character files in this folder.

Recommended structure:

- assets/avatars/Luna/Luna.vrm
- assets/avatars/Nova/Nova.model3.json
- assets/avatars/Kiro/Kiro.vrm

The repo keeps the manifest so the loader can discover avatars without hardcoding
paths in the runtime.

Use the `manifest.json` file to register each avatar model. The runtime will then
load it as a Live2D or VRM asset and bind it into the multi-source VTuber scene.

Do not place placeholder SVG images here; use real model files created for VTuber
production or purchased/commissioned assets.
